; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 29. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0881E2! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: The tropics are[N]amazingly hot[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Even the air looks[N]warped. Everything is[N]shimmering.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: We should rest in[N]this village today.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_bones'
nvAC_bones.dialogstring_088020! `[CLD][DEF][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]These bones aren't badly[N]weathered.[N]Whoever died here, it[N]wasn't very long ago.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08826B! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This place feels[N]ominous.[WAI][N]No people anywhere, but[N]there are bones scattered[N]through the village.[WAI][N]We should look inside one[N]of the houses.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAE_stone_girl1'
nvAE_stone_girl1.dialogstring_0892E4! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]A stone statue of a girl[N]stands quietly.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_kara'
nvAD_kara.dialogstring_088B32! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I don't like it[N]here. But we're exhausted,[N]and at least this house[N]gives us shelter.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: It's just right for[N]us, isn't it? We can rest[N]as much as we like.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_erik'
nvAD_erik.dialogstring_088BD8! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm already[N]exhausted. I don't think[N]I'll wake up for a hundred[N]hours.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_hamlet'
nvAD_hamlet.dialogstring_088C47! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Squee squee…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAD_kara'
nvAD_kara.dialogstring_088B8B! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Let's rest here for[N]today.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0882C7! `[CLD][DEF][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]Exhausted by the journey,[N]the party falls into a[N]deep sleep.[FIN]Some time later…[END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08830F! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:2]Will: Mrrrm… Hamlet…?[N]Let me sleep a little[N]more…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2][DLY:1]Kara: Ugh… Wait a second,[N]Will… Don't touch me in[N]weird places…[FIN][CLD][PAU:3C][BOR:7][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Huh…! Who…?[N]Who are you…?![END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_08839D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Do they mean to eat[N]us[AD]?)[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Look at the[N]children. They're skin and[N]bones[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Remember the boy in[N]Freejia? He said his[N]people were starving.[FIN]Maybe this is where he[N]came from.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Then those bones we[N]found[AD][WAI][N]Could hunger have driven[N]them to eat the dead?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: W-we're going to be[N]next[AD]![END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0887C6! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: Hamlet… Why do you[N]look so sad?[FIN][DLY:2]It's almost like you know[N]you're going to leave us…[END]`
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_088811! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Eeeeeeeeeeeeeek…!![FIN][DLY:0]Hamlet…! Hamlet…!![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0][DLY:1]Will: Hamlet… Why…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hamlet'
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_08885C! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Waah… Hamlet… Going[N]and dying before us isn't[N]fair…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hamlet…[N]*Sob*… *Sob*…[END]`
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_08890E! `[CLD][DEF][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2]A familiar voice echoes[N]in their minds.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Shira: Everyone, listen.[N]Hamlet gave his life so[N]these people could live.[WAI][N]He chose to save them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Mom…? Is that you?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Shira: Will… All of you[N]who have come this far.[WAI][N]The comet is drawing near.[N]The old powers are waking[N]with it.[WAI][N]Your paths are joining[N]now. Use what each of[N]you has learned.[WAI][N]Will, gather the Mystic[N]Statues and return to the[N]Tower of Babel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_staring_man'
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088EDC! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]The man stares silently[N]into Will's eyes.[FIN]Stare back?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088F15! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]The man seems to search[N]for his own reflection[N]in Will's eyes.[FIN]They share no language,[N]yet the first hint of[N]mutual understanding[N]appears.[END]`
nvAC_staring_man.dialogstring_088F71! `[CLR]The man looks away.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hand_man'
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088CE0! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The man holds out a[N]trembling hand.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Take his hand?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088D1F! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]They cannot understand one[N]another's words, but the[N]gesture says enough.[END]`
nvAC_hand_man.dialogstring_088D54! `[CLR]The man lowers his[N]outstretched hand.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_dumpling_man'
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088DDE! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The man offers a tiny[N]piece of food.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Try it?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088E0F! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It seems to be crushed[N]insects pressed into a[N]small dumpling.[FIN]The taste turns Will's[N]stomach, but the[N]gift itself needs no[N]translation.[END]`
nvAC_dumpling_man.dialogstring_088E72! `[DEF]The man makes a sad face[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_map_kid'
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_088FE1! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]The boy points toward the[N]northeast.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]Show him the map?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_08901E! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]The boy draws a large[N]temple on the map.[FIN]Though they share no[N]words, he clearly wants[N]Will to go there.[END]`
nvAC_map_kid.dialogstring_089078! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]The boy stops pointing[N]and looks northeast.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_beckon_kid'
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089126! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][SFX:10]The boy tugs Will's[N]sleeve and beckons him to[N]follow.[FIN]Go with him?[N] Yes[N] No`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089178! `[DEF]The boy smiles and[N]beckons with his hand.[END]`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_089190! `[CLR][DEF][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]The boy lets go of[N]Will's sleeve.[END]`
nvAC_beckon_kid.dialogstring_0891A2! `[DEF]The boy stands before a[N]skeleton, tears filling[N]his eyes.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Family? A friend?[N]There's no way to ask.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_hamlet'
nvAC_hamlet.dialogstring_0888AD! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Squee squee[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](I'll never hear that[N]sound again.)[FIN][CLD][DEF]Smoke from the cooking[N]fire drifts through[N]the village.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_erik'
nvAC_erik.dialogstring_0885DC! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: When we first saw[N]the bones, I thought these[N]people must be monsters.[WAI][N]But they were starving.[N]They've lost brothers,[N]sisters, parents…[WAI][N]I don't know what I'd do[N]if I were that hungry.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'nvAC_kara'
nvAC_kara.dialogstring_0884FB! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: How could Hamlet[N]jump into the fire knowing[N]what would happen[AD]?[WAI][N]Hamlet[AD] You brave little[N]pig.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Kara[AD][WAI][N]About what I said in[N]the tunnel[AD][WAI][N]I'm sorry.[WAI][N]I didn't understand him.[END]`
